                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Data scope:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'> 2,025 distinct FY2026 new, non-renewal construction permits. Approval time excludes weekends and legal DC holidays.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Interaction:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'> Select a work category or ward to filter the dashboard; clear selections to restore the full dataset.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Interpretation:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'> Small sample groups require caution. Approval-time bands are analytical groupings, not official DDOT service standards. See the accompanying methodology report for assumptions and limitations.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
